  "details": "It appears that on the mobile version of the VR chat you cannot log in if your password contains the percent symbol. \"%\" while trying to login after hitting the login button it just gives me a error advising the username or password is incorrect. I was only able to successfully login when my password did not contain \"%\" and once I had re-added that symbol I could not login anymore. I have replicated it on 2 different devices \n\nSM-X910 Tab s9 ultra\n\nSM-S908E s22 ultra\n\nAlso as part of my troubleshooting tried it on 3 different internet connection (Aussie broadband, optus and Telstra) and also would get the same error",
